{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">朝鮮日前舉行實彈演習，測試砲兵及導彈部隊。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.DRILL.1030.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026chaQfDSpEc1789350927.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.NK.DRILL.1030.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">朝中社周一報道，朝鮮人民軍各級聯合部隊過去周六展開協同火力打擊訓練。參訓部隊由5個火砲和導彈聯合部隊選派，出動各種無人機、巡航導彈、大口徑熱壓火箭砲、戰術彈道導彈等新型武器系統。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">報道稱，所有武器精準打擊靶標，保障火力打擊一致性與同時性，充分顯示集中火力強大破壞力。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.DRILL.1030_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026VpJ3XBOUCY1789350942.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.NK.DRILL.1030_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">韓國聯合參謀本部早前稱，過去周六朝鮮從元山一帶向東部發射多枚彈道導彈，是近一個月第四次，估計很可能是發射「火星-11」短程彈道導彈和600毫米超大型火箭砲。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:34.112340+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}